  <section class="chapter" id="brand-new">
    <div class="chapter-num">Chapter 14</div>
    <h2>Brand-new — check before you rely on these</h2>
    <p>These landed in the last couple of JavaScript releases. They work today in current browsers and current Node — but "current" is doing real work in that sentence, and it's worth actually checking rather than assuming, especially if a project has any reason to support older environments.</p>

