    <CodeBlock code={groupByEx} lang="js" />

    <h3>Set methods: union(), intersection(), difference()</h3>
    <p class="support-tag caution"><span class="support-icon">⚠</span> Newer (ES2025) — shipped in current browser versions and recent Node; the newest feature in this course, double-check before depending on it.</p>
