    <h3>structuredClone()</h3>
    <p class="support-tag good"><span class="support-icon">✓</span> Baseline since 2022 — safe to use, no compiling needed.</p>
    <p>Not brand-new, but worth knowing alongside spread (Chapter 6): a genuine deep clone, built into the language, no library required:</p>
